  ⚠ angular-template(no-nested-tags): <a> elements must not be nested! This breaks angular incremental hydration as all browsers will convert "<a>1<a>2</a>3</a>" into "<a>1</a><a>2</a>3", creating a DOM mismatch between SSR and Angular
